<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
        body { font-family: DejaVu Sans, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #333; margin: 24px; }
        h1 { color: #1a365d; font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        h2 { color: #2c5282; font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .bus-info { background: #ebf8ff; border-left: 4px solid #3182ce; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 16px 0; font-weight: 500; }
        ul { margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 24px; }
        li { margin: 4px 0; }
        .city { margin-bottom: 24px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Community Day – Tourist Guide</h1>
    <p>Welcome to Community Day! While you're in Novi Sad and Belgrade, here are recommended attractions you can visit.</p>

    <div class="bus-info">
        <strong>Bus:</strong> {{ busInfo }}
    </div>

    <div class="city">
        <h2>Novi Sad</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Petrovaradin Fortress</strong> – Historic fortress with views of the Danube and EXIT festival venue</li>
            <li><strong>City center (Zmaj Jovina, Laze Telečkog)</strong> – Stroll along the main street, cafés, restaurants</li>
            <li><strong>Serbian National Theatre</strong> – One of the oldest cultural institutions</li>
            <li><strong>Futoški Park</strong> – Largest city park, ideal for walks</li>
            <li><strong>Danube Park</strong> – Park in the city center by the Danube</li>
            <li><strong>Museum of Vojvodina</strong> – History and culture of Vojvodina</li>
            <li><strong>Štrand</strong> – City beach on the Danube (summer)</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="city">
        <h2>Belgrade</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Kalemegdan</strong> – Fortress with views of the Danube and Sava confluence</li>
            <li><strong>Knez Mihailova Street</strong> – Main pedestrian street, shopping, cafés</li>
            <li><strong>Skadarlija</strong> – Bohemian quarter, restaurants, music</li>
            <li><strong>Church of Saint Sava</strong> – One of the largest Orthodox churches</li>
            <li><strong>Ada Ciganlija</strong> – Island/lake, beach, sports (summer)</li>
            <li><strong>Museum of Contemporary Art</strong> – Contemporary art</li>
            <li><strong>Zemun</strong> – Old part of the city, Gardoš tower, restaurants by the Danube</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 9pt; color: #718096;">Community Day – Enjoy the event!</p>
</body>
</html>
